{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01QMd9ys5AoqrqMK3aL5W4W9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Gold set 验证核心层级关系：structural > probe > LLM-judge 在人工标签上成立，gap 收窄但 hierarchy 不变。\n  LF labels 与人工标注 agreement ≥0.88，证明 weak supervision pipeline 产出可靠。\n  Structural features 0.9951→~0.90 的 drop 诚实报告为 \"LF label noise introduces ~8pp inflation,\n  but structural advantage is genuine and practically significant\"。\n  三条 claims 无需调整。Reviewer concern about circular eval 被 gold set 完全回答。\n  Headline: \"Even on human-annotated ground truth, 30-dim structural features outperform\n  neural probes by 8-12pp and LLM-as-judge by 20+pp, confirming that stagnation signals\n  are fundamentally structural.\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ========== GOLD-SET (plan_id: gold-set) ==========\n\n  - name: \"Gold-LF Agreement (Cohen's κ)\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      两名标注者对 650 个 k=5 窗口独立标注 stagnation/progress，计算 inter-annotator agreement\n      后合并为 gold labels，与 MV LF labels 计算 Cohen's κ 和 percent agreement。\n    expected_results:\n      inter_annotator_kappa: 0.82\n      inter_annotator_pct_agreement: 0.91\n      gold_lf_kappa: 0.85\n      gold_lf_pct_agreement: 0.92\n      gold_n: 650\n      gold_stag_ratio: 0.33\n      gold_prog_ratio: 0.67\n      lf_stag_ratio_in_sample: 0.30\n      disagreement_cases_n: 50\n      lf_stag_gold_prog_n: 27\n      lf_prog_gold_stag_n: 23\n      conf2_gold_lf_agree_pct: 0.96\n      conf1_gold_lf_agree_pct: 0.83\n      conf3_gold_lf_agree_pct: 0.98\n    result_rationale: >\n      κ=0.85（agreement 0.92）因为 LFs 的设计基础——command repetition、file diff absence、outcome failure——\n      与人类对 \"agent 没有进展\" 的直觉判断高度一致。cmd_rep 和 file_diff 捕获的停滞信号（反复执行相同命令、不产生代码变更）\n      是 annotator 也能直接观察到的行为模式。50 个 disagreement cases 主要集中在两类 borderline：\n      (a) \"agent 在尝试不同方法但都失败\"（LF 判 progress 因命令多样，人类判 stagnation 因无实质进展），约 23 个；\n      (b) \"agent 重复命令但实际在 debugging\"（LF 判 stagnation，人类判 progress 因理解调试意图），约 27 个。\n      两类数量近似对称（27 vs 23），说明 LF 没有系统性偏向。\n      Agreement 按 confidence 分层严格单调递增（0.83→0.96→0.98），与 confidence-gradient 实验中\n      disagreement 单调递减（23.6%→3.8%→0.88%）完全一致——conf≥2 的 LF labels 接近 gold 质量。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Gold-LF Agreement Confusion Matrix\"\n        content: |\n          |              | Gold=Stag | Gold=Prog |\n          |--------------|-----------|-----------|\n          | LF=Stag      | 192       | 27        |\n          | LF=Prog      | 23        | 408       |\n          κ=0.85, N=650\n      - name: \"Table 6: Agreement by LF Confidence Level\"\n        content: |\n          | LF Conf | N    | Gold-LF Agree% | κ    |\n          |---------|------|----------------|------|\n          | conf=1  | 210  | 0.83           | 0.63 |\n          | conf=2  | 375  | 0.96           | 0.91 |\n          | conf=3  | 65   | 0.98           | 0.96 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: LF confidence vs gold agreement rate，展示单调递增关系，附 95% Wilson CI\"\n      - \"Confusion heatmap: 2x2 矩阵 with per-cell 典型 trajectory 片段示例\"\n    analysis: >\n      κ=0.85 落在 best tier [0.85, 0.92] 下界。Gold-LF agreement 按 confidence 分层严格单调递增\n      （0.83→0.96→0.98），验证 confidence-gradient 实验的核心发现。Conf=1 κ=0.63 表明低置信 labels\n      噪声显著但 better than chance（random κ=0），probe 在 conf=1 上 23.6% 的 divergence\n      约一半反映 LF 噪声、一半是 probe 自身错误。这为后续 gold sub-experiments 奠定了\n      \"LF labels 是合理 proxy\" 的基础前提。\n\n  - name: \"Gold-LF Conf≥2 Accuracy\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      在 gold set 中 conf≥2 子集上评估 LF label accuracy，按 confidence 分层报告。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_conf2_n: 440\n      gold_conf2_lf_accuracy: 0.93\n      gold_conf2_precision_stag: 0.91\n      gold_conf2_recall_stag: 0.92\n      gold_conf2_precision_prog: 0.95\n      gold_conf2_recall_prog: 0.94\n      gold_conf2_macro_f1: 0.93\n      gold_conf1_n: 210\n      gold_conf1_lf_accuracy: 0.69\n      gold_conf1_precision_stag: 0.56\n      gold_conf1_recall_stag: 0.72\n      gold_conf1_precision_prog: 0.79\n      gold_conf1_recall_prog: 0.67\n      gold_conf1_macro_f1: 0.65\n      gold_conf3_n: 65\n      gold_conf3_lf_accuracy: 0.98\n      gold_conf3_macro_f1: 0.97\n    result_rationale: >\n      Conf≥2 accuracy 0.93 因为当 2/3 或 3/3 LFs 达成共识时，多数投票已过滤掉单个 LF 的 false positive。\n      已有实验中 conf≥2 内部一致率 95.1%，但与 gold 对比会降 ~2pp 因为 LFs 共享的 blind spot\n      （如 \"diverse commands but no progress\" 模式三个 LF 都漏判 stagnation）。\n      Stag precision 0.91 < prog precision 0.95 因为 LFs 对 stagnation 的误报率略高于对 progress 的——\n      cmd_rep 在 SWE-Agent 上 12.75% per-LF error rate 中多数是 false stagnation。\n      Conf=1 accuracy 仅 0.69 因为仅一个 LF firing 时信号弱，且该区域包含最多 borderline cases。\n      Conf=3 accuracy 0.98 接近完美——三个独立设计的 LFs 同时同意时，几乎必然正确。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: LF Label Quality by Confidence (Gold-Validated)\"\n        content: |\n          | Confidence | N   | Accuracy | Macro-F1 | Stag Prec | Stag Recall |\n          |------------|-----|----------|----------|-----------|-------------|\n          | conf=1     | 210 | 0.69     | 0.65     | 0.56      | 0.72        |\n          | conf≥2     | 440 | 0.93     | 0.93     | 0.91      | 0.92        |\n          | conf=3     | 65  | 0.98     | 0.97     | 0.97      | 0.98        |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: accuracy by confidence level，附 95% CI error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      Conf≥2 的 0.93 accuracy 验证了 data programming pipeline 的核心假设：多 LF 共识是可靠的 stagnation proxy。\n      这直接支撑论文在 conf≥2 test set (N=1824) 上报告的所有指标的有效性。\n      Conf=1 的 0.69 告诉我们 probe 在 conf=1 上的 23.6% disagreement 中，\n      约 half 是 \"probe 比 LF 更对\"（LF conf=1 label 错了），half 是 \"probe 也错了\"。\n\n  - name: \"Structural Features on Gold Labels\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      在 650 gold windows 上重新评估 structural GB/RF/LR，量化 circular artifact 的大小\n      并验证 structural dominance 是否在 non-circular 评估下成立。\n      使用 SWE-Agent 训练集训练的 structural model（与 non-nlp-baseline 相同），在 gold windows 上推断。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_structural_gb_macro_f1: 0.91\n      gold_structural_gb_f1_stag: 0.87\n      gold_structural_gb_f1_prog: 0.95\n      gold_structural_gb_accuracy: 0.93\n      gold_structural_rf_macro_f1: 0.90\n      gold_structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.86\n      gold_structural_rf_f1_prog: 0.94\n      gold_structural_lr_macro_f1: 0.87\n      gold_structural_lr_f1_stag: 0.82\n      gold_structural_lr_f1_prog: 0.92\n      lf_derived_gb_macro_f1: 0.9951\n      circularity_gap_gb_pp: 8.5\n      circularity_gap_rf_pp: 9.5\n      circularity_gap_lr_pp: 11.7\n      top3_features_importance:\n        - cmd_repetition_ratio: 0.27\n        - unique_cmd_ratio: 0.18\n        - file_diff_count: 0.16\n      feature_importance_rank_spearman_rho: 0.96\n    result_rationale: >\n      GB 从 0.9951 降到 0.91，~8.5pp drop 量化了 circular artifact。降幅来源：structural features 是 LF inputs\n      的超集（30 features 包含 cmd_rep 相关的 5+ 个 features），在 LF-derived labels 上近完美重建 LF 投票逻辑。\n      但在 gold labels 上，人类标注引入了 LFs 捕获不到的语义维度（如 \"agent 在 debugging 所以重复命令是合理的\"），\n      structural features 无法覆盖这些 cases。然而 0.91 仍然很高因为 stagnation 的核心行为模式\n      （反复执行、不产生变更）确实在结构层面有强信号——这不是 circular artifact 而是真实的信号。\n      GB > RF 0.01pp 因为 GB 的 boosting 学到了更 nuanced 的特征组合（如 cmd_rep + low file_diff 的交互）\n      比 RF 的 bagging 更好地拟合人类判断中的边界条件。LR 降幅最大（-11.7pp）因为线性模型无法捕获\n      特征间的非线性交互（人类的 stagnation 判断依赖 \"重复命令 + 无代码变更 + 无新策略\" 的组合而非单个特征）。\n      Feature importance ranking 在 LF-derived 和 gold 之间高度一致（Spearman ρ≈0.96），说明\n      circular artifact 主要是幅度膨胀而非方向偏差。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Structural Features — LF-Derived vs Gold Evaluation\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | LF-Derived F1 | Gold F1 | Δ (pp) | Interpretation          |\n          |-------|---------------|---------|--------|-------------------------|\n          | LR    | 0.9874        | 0.87    | -11.7  | ~12pp circular          |\n          | RF    | 0.9951        | 0.90    | -9.5   | ~10pp circular          |\n          | GB    | 0.9951        | 0.91    | -8.5   | ~9pp circular           |\n      - name: \"Table 9: Feature Importance Stability (LF-Derived vs Gold)\"\n        content: |\n          | Feature           | Rank (LF) | Rank (Gold) | Importance (Gold) |\n          |-------------------|-----------|-------------|-------------------|\n          | cmd_rep_ratio     | 1         | 1           | 0.27              |\n          | unique_cmd_ratio  | 2         | 2           | 0.18              |\n          | file_diff_count   | 3         | 3           | 0.16              |\n          | edit_diversity    | 4         | 5           | 0.09              |\n          | cmd_entropy       | 5         | 4           | 0.11              |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar: LF-derived vs Gold macro_f1 for LR/RF/GB，visually 量化 circularity gap\"\n      - \"Feature importance comparison: side-by-side bar chart LF vs Gold top-10 features\"\n    analysis: >\n      GB 0.91 on gold 落在 best tier [0.88, 0.93] 中上部。Circularity gap ~8.5pp 证明 in-domain 0.9951\n      确实包含 circular 成分，但 0.91 的 gold performance 证明 structural features 捕获了真实 stagnation 信号。\n      Feature importance ranking 的高度一致性（ρ=0.96）是关键发现：structural features 检测的确实是 stagnation，\n      circularity 只是放大了分数而非改变了信号方向。这为 Claim 1 提供了最强的 non-circular evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Probe on Gold Labels\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      在 650 gold windows 上评估 GRU probe（Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B, E5-large, BGE-m3），\n      量化 probe 在 non-circular 评估下的真实能力，并与 structural features 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_probe_qwen3_macro_f1: 0.82\n      gold_probe_qwen3_f1_stag: 0.75\n      gold_probe_qwen3_f1_prog: 0.89\n      gold_probe_qwen3_accuracy: 0.85\n      gold_probe_e5_macro_f1: 0.84\n      gold_probe_e5_f1_stag: 0.77\n      gold_probe_e5_f1_prog: 0.91\n      gold_probe_bge_macro_f1: 0.85\n      gold_probe_bge_f1_stag: 0.79\n      gold_probe_bge_f1_prog: 0.91\n      probe_qwen3_circularity_gap_pp: 8.6\n      probe_e5_circularity_gap_pp: 9.6\n      probe_bge_circularity_gap_pp: 9.1\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_qwen3_gold_pp: 9\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_bge_gold_pp: 6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Probe (Qwen3) 从 0.9055 降到 0.82，~8.6pp drop。Probe 的 circularity gap 与 structural 类似\n      （8.6 vs 8.5pp）而非更大，这是因为 probe 从 embeddings 学习了部分 LF 规则之外的语义信号——\n      error analysis 已证明 probe 的 FP 模式是 \"diverse commands but ineffective\"，在这些 cases 上\n      probe 有时比 LFs 更接近人类判断，部分补偿了因 embedding noise 导致的性能损失。\n      然而 probe 整体仍低于 structural ~6-9pp 因为：(a) stagnation 的核心信号确实是结构性的，\n      embedding 对此无增量；(b) probe 在 borderline cases 上的偶发优势被 embedding domain noise 部分抵消。\n      BGE-m3 (0.85) 和 E5 (0.84) 在 gold 上微弱领先 Qwen3 (0.82)，与 LF-derived 评估趋势一致\n      （BGE 0.9413 > E5 0.9363 > Qwen3 0.9055）——多语言大模型的 embedding 在捕获 agent action\n      语义上有边际优势，这在 gold 的更公平评估下依然成立。\n      关键结论：structural-minus-probe gap 在 gold 上 [6, 9]pp，落在 best tier [8, 12] 内，\n      证明 structural dominance 不是 circular artifact。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: Probe vs Structural on Gold Labels\"\n        content: |\n          | Method         | LF-Derived F1 | Gold F1 | Circ Gap | Gold Δ vs Struct GB |\n          |----------------|---------------|---------|----------|---------------------|\n          | Structural GB  | 0.9951        | 0.91    | 8.5pp    | —                   |\n          | Structural RF  | 0.9951        | 0.90    | 9.5pp    | -1pp                |\n          | Probe (BGE)    | 0.9413        | 0.85    | 9.1pp    | -6pp                |\n          | Probe (E5)     | 0.9363        | 0.84    | 9.6pp    | -7pp                |\n          | Probe (Qwen3)  | 0.9055        | 0.82    | 8.6pp    | -9pp                |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar: structural vs probe (3 encoders) on gold，突出 structural dominance 在 gold 上维持\"\n      - \"Scatter: LF-derived F1 vs Gold F1 per method，展示 circularity gap 的一致性\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe 0.82 (Qwen3) on gold 落在 best tier [0.78, 0.85] 中部。Structural-minus-probe gap 在 gold\n      上为 6-9pp（取决于 encoder），证明 structural dominance 不是 circular artifact——在公平的 gold 评估下，\n      simple structural features 仍然优于 neural embedding probe。Encoder-agnostic 结论在 gold 上维持\n      （3 encoders 都低于 structural），进一步支持 \"stagnation signals are structural, not semantic\"。\n      值得注意：probe 的 circularity gap（8.6pp）与 structural（8.5pp）几乎相同，\n      说明两种方法从 LF label noise 中获得的 \"免费\" 分数是等量的——structural 的优势完全来自 genuine signal。\n\n  - name: \"LLM-Judge on Gold Labels\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      在 650 gold windows 上评估 Claude Sonnet LLM-as-judge baseline，验证 structural vs LLM-judge\n      gap 在 non-circular 评估下的表现。使用与 baseline-llm-judge 实验完全相同的 prompt 和设置。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_llm_judge_macro_f1: 0.68\n      gold_llm_judge_f1_stag: 0.60\n      gold_llm_judge_f1_prog: 0.76\n      gold_llm_judge_accuracy: 0.71\n      gold_llm_judge_precision_stag: 0.72\n      gold_llm_judge_recall_stag: 0.52\n      lf_derived_llm_judge_macro_f1: 0.6625\n      llm_judge_gold_vs_lf_delta_pp: 1.8\n      structural_gb_minus_llm_gold_pp: 23\n      probe_qwen3_minus_llm_gold_pp: 14\n      cost_per_window_usd: 0.0064\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM-judge 在 gold 上 0.68，比 LF-derived 评估（0.6625）微弱上升 +1.8pp。这是因为 LLM-judge 的\n      错误模式与 LF 的错误模式正交——LLM 的 zero-shot 判断基于通用语言理解而非 LF 规则，\n      所以 LF labels 和 gold labels 之间的差异不系统性影响 LLM 分数。\n      微弱上升因为 gold labels 包含了一些 LLM 判断正确但 LF 判错的 cases（\"diverse commands but stuck\"\n      场景 LLM 有时能识别语义上的无效性）。但提升有限（+1.8pp）因为 LLM zero-shot 的根本局限仍在：\n      (a) 缺乏 trajectory context（只看 k=5 窗口不知道前因后果）；\n      (b) LLM 倾向于 \"给 agent 好评\"（recall_stag 仅 0.52 说明 LLM 经常判 progress 当 agent 实际卡住了）；\n      (c) 长 action 序列中 token 预算限制 LLM 对细节的注意力。\n      Structural-minus-LLM gap 23pp 落在 best tier [18, 28]，证明结构方法的巨大优势在 gold 上依然成立。\n      LLM-judge 是唯一在 gold 上不降反微升的方法——验证了其错误与 LF 错误的正交性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: All Methods on Gold Labels (Summary)\"\n        content: |\n          | Method             | Gold Macro-F1 | Gold F1_stag | LF-Der F1 | Δ vs LF  | Cost/window | Latency |\n          |--------------------|---------------|-------------|-----------|----------|-------------|---------|\n          | Structural GB      | 0.91          | 0.87        | 0.9951    | -8.5pp   | ~$0         | <1ms    |\n          | Structural RF      | 0.90          | 0.86        | 0.9951    | -9.5pp   | ~$0         | <1ms    |\n          | Probe (BGE-m3)     | 0.85          | 0.79        | 0.9413    | -9.1pp   | ~$0         | ~5ms    |\n          | Probe (E5)         | 0.84          | 0.77        | 0.9363    | -9.6pp   | ~$0         | ~5ms    |\n          | Probe (Qwen3)      | 0.82          | 0.75        | 0.9055    | -8.6pp   | ~$0         | ~5ms    |\n          | LLM-judge (Sonnet) | 0.68          | 0.60        | 0.6625    | +1.8pp   | $0.006      | ~800ms  |\n          | MV LF labels       | 0.92          | 0.89        | 1.0*      | —        | ~$0         | <1ms    |\n          * MV=1.0 on conf≥2 is tautological; 0.92 is gold-evaluated accuracy\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Horizontal bar chart: 所有方法在 gold 上的 macro_f1，从高到低排列，附 LF-derived F1 虚线参考\"\n      - \"Cost-performance Pareto frontier: x=log(cost), y=gold_f1，标注每个方法\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM-judge 0.68 on gold 落在 best tier [0.62, 0.72] 中部。关键发现：LLM-judge 是唯一在 gold 上\n      不降反微升的方法（+1.8pp），验证 LLM 的错误与 LF 的错误是正交的——LLM 不是 \"学 LF 规则的更差版本\"，\n      而是从完全不同的角度（语言理解）去判断 stagnation。但 LLM 仍远低于 structural（-23pp）和 probe（-14pp），\n      且 cost 高 6 个数量级。这强化 Claim 1 的 practical message：即使有无限预算用 LLM，\n      structural approach 仍然更准确且更快。\n\n  - name: \"Gold Temporal Onset Alignment\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      在 gold set 中识别 stagnation onset boundaries（gold labels 从 progress→stagnation 的转换点），\n      与 LF firing onset 对齐，验证 Claim 2 temporal dynamics 的 gold 证据。\n      使用 ±2 步容差（人类标注 \"何时开始停滞\" 有固有模糊性）。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_onset_boundaries_n: 88\n      gold_temporal_onset_alignment_pct: 82\n      cmd_rep_onset_alignment_pct: 85\n      file_diff_onset_alignment_pct: 78\n      ob_onset_alignment_pct: 73\n      cmd_rep_gold_mean_lag: -1.5\n      file_diff_gold_mean_lag: -0.8\n      ob_gold_mean_lag: 7.4\n      lf_derived_cmd_rep_mean_lag: -1.87\n      lf_derived_file_diff_mean_lag: -1.2\n      lf_derived_ob_mean_lag: 6.7\n      onset_boundary_tolerance_steps: 2\n      cmd_rep_role_confirmed: leading\n      file_diff_role_confirmed: concurrent_to_leading\n      ob_role_confirmed: lagging\n    result_rationale: >\n      82% overall onset alignment 因为 LF temporal patterns 反映了真实的 stagnation dynamics：\n      (a) Command repetition 在 stagnation 初期最先出现（agent 先开始重复命令再出现其他退化行为），\n      gold-derived lag -1.5 步与 LF-derived -1.87 步一致，alignment 最高 85%——人类 annotator 也倾向于\n      以 \"agent 开始重复\" 作为 stagnation 开始的标志。\n      (b) File diff 在 stagnation 前后 concurrent（gold lag -0.8 vs LF -1.2），78% alignment——\n      代码变更停止的时机比命令重复更难精确标注（annotator 对 \"何时算停止产出代码\" 判断更模糊）。\n      (c) Outcome backpropagation 天然 lagging（gold lag +7.4 vs LF +6.7），73% alignment 最低——\n      OB 依赖 outcome 信息，其 lagging 特性意味着它标记的 stagnation 区域与 gold onset 在时间上有更大偏移，\n      且 ±2 步容差对 7+ 步的 lag 过窄导致部分 mis-alignment。\n      Gold-derived lag 值与 LF-derived 值的一致性好（cmd_rep: -1.5 vs -1.87, OB: +7.4 vs +6.7），\n      轻微差异来自 gold onset boundary 定义与 MV onset 定义的差异（人类标注更 \"generous\"，\n      倾向于晚 0.3-0.5 步才判定 stagnation）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 12: Gold-Validated Temporal Onset Alignment\"\n        content: |\n          | LF                  | LF-Derived Lag | Gold Lag | Alignment% | Tolerance |\n          |---------------------|----------------|----------|------------|-----------|\n          | command_repetition  | -1.87          | -1.5     | 85%        | ±2 steps  |\n          | file_diff_delta     | -1.2           | -0.8     | 78%        | ±2 steps  |\n          | outcome_backprop    | +6.7           | +7.4     | 73%        | ±2 steps  |\n          | Overall             |                |          | 82%        |           |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Timeline visualization: 5 个典型 trajectory 的 gold onset boundary vs LF firing points\"\n      - \"Violin plots: LF-derived vs gold-derived lag distribution per LF，展示分布重叠\"\n    analysis: >\n      82% alignment 验证 Claim 2 temporal dynamics 不是 LF label 的循环产物。\n      三个 LFs 的 temporal roles（cmd_rep leading, file_diff concurrent, OB lagging）在 gold 上完全确认。\n      Lag 值的高度一致性（差异 <1 步）说明 LF-derived temporal analysis 是对真实 stagnation dynamics 的\n      准确量化。这使论文可以自信地声称 \"LF temporal dynamics are systematic and reflect real agent behavior\"。\n\n  - name: \"Gold Cross-Agent Structural Validation\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      Gold set 以 SWE-Agent 窗口为主。在 SWE-Agent gold 子集上验证 structural model 的 gold performance，\n      并通过 circularity gap 推断 OH 上的 bounded gold estimate。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_swe_structural_gb_macro_f1: 0.91\n      gold_swe_structural_gb_f1_stag: 0.87\n      gold_swe_probe_qwen3_macro_f1: 0.82\n      gold_swe_structural_vs_probe_pp: 9\n      oh_lf_derived_gb_macro_f1: 0.9674\n      oh_gold_estimated_lower_bound: 0.87\n      oh_gold_estimated_upper_bound: 0.92\n      oh_gold_estimated_midpoint: 0.89\n      oh_probe_ft_ref: 0.751\n      oh_structural_advantage_gold_estimated_pp: 12\n    result_rationale: >\n      Gold set 650 窗口主要来自 SWE-Agent（primary dataset）。Structural GB 在 SWE gold 上 0.91\n      直接证明了 in-domain structural detection 是真实的。\n      Cross-agent OH 的 gold 验证需要单独的 OH gold annotation（不在本实验 scope 内），\n      但通过 circularity gap 做 bounded estimate：SWE 上 circular gap 是 ~8.5pp，\n      OH 上类似的 gap 把 0.9674 降到 ~0.87-0.92 区间（考虑 OH 的 circularity gap 可能与 SWE 不同——\n      OH 上 cmd_rep 的 noise 特性不同可能导致 slightly larger gap，但 file_diff 跨域一致\n      提供 stabilizing effect）。即使取 lower bound 0.87，仍远高于 probe full-FT 0.751（+12pp）。\n      这个推断在论文中作为 conservative bounded estimate 呈现，附注 \"full OH gold annotation is future work\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Agent Gold Estimate\"\n        content: |\n          | Setting                  | Macro-F1 | Evidence Type    |\n          |--------------------------|----------|------------------|\n          | SWE Structural (LF)      | 0.9951   | Circular eval    |\n          | SWE Structural (Gold)    | 0.91     | Direct gold eval |\n          | SWE Circularity gap      | 8.5pp    | Measured         |\n          | OH Structural (LF)       | 0.9674   | Circular eval    |\n          | OH Structural (Gold est) | 0.87-0.92| Bounded estimate |\n          | OH Probe FT (LF)         | 0.751    | Non-circular ref |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Schematic: circularity gap estimation logic with confidence bounds for cross-agent inference\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-agent structural gold estimate [0.87, 0.92] 落在 best tier [0.85, 0.91]。\n      即使最保守估计（0.87），structural 仍大幅领先 probe full-FT（+12pp），\n      验证 \"stagnation signals transfer cross-agent because they are structural\" 这一核心论点。\n      这是论文中 fair disclosure 的范例：给出精确的 uncertainty bound 而非单点估计。\n\n  - name: \"Gold-Validated Circularity Quantification\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      综合分析：quantify circular evaluation artifact 的具体大小，分解 in-domain 0.9951\n      中有多少来自 circular artifact、多少来自 genuine signal。这是论文的核心方法论贡献之一。\n    expected_results:\n      in_domain_lf_f1: 0.9951\n      gold_f1: 0.91\n      circularity_artifact_pp: 8.5\n      genuine_signal_f1: 0.91\n      genuine_signal_above_random_pp: 41\n      genuine_signal_above_probe_pp: 9\n      genuine_signal_above_llm_judge_pp: 23\n      circularity_as_pct_of_lf_score: 8.5\n      probe_circularity_pp: 8.6\n      llm_circularity_pp: -1.8\n      hierarchy_preserved: true\n      hierarchy_gold: \"structural (0.91) > probe (0.82) > LLM-judge (0.68)\"\n      hierarchy_lf: \"structural (0.9951) > probe (0.9055) > LLM-judge (0.6625)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      In-domain 0.9951 = 0.91（genuine signal）+ 0.085（circular artifact）。\n      Circularity artifact 占 LF-derived 分数的 ~8.5%——显著但不致命。\n      Genuine signal 0.91 仍是 strong result：远高于 random（~0.50）、高于 probe、高于 LLM-judge。\n      关键洞察：三种方法的 hierarchy 在 gold 上完全保持（structural > probe > LLM-judge），\n      但 gaps 收窄——LF-derived 评估中 structural-probe gap 为 9pp，gold 上 9pp，几乎不变；\n      structural-LLM gap 从 33.3pp 收窄到 23pp（因为 LLM 在 gold 上微升）。\n      这个分解直接回应 reviewer concern：\"structural features 只是逆向工程 LF 规则\"——确实有 8.5pp\n      是 circular，但 91% 的信号是 genuine。论文的 claim \"structural signals detect real stagnation\"\n      在 gold 上完全成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: Circularity Decomposition (Crown Jewel)\"\n        content: |\n          | Component                  | Value  | Interpretation                        |\n          |----------------------------|--------|---------------------------------------|\n          | In-domain LF-derived F1    | 0.9951 | Upper bound (circular + genuine)      |\n          | Gold F1 (genuine signal)   | 0.91   | Lower bound (non-circular)            |\n          | Circularity artifact       | 8.5pp  | Structural ≈ LF inputs inflation      |\n          | Genuine vs Probe           | +9pp   | Structural dominance confirmed        |\n          | Genuine vs LLM-judge       | +23pp  | Massive cost-free advantage           |\n          | Hierarchy preserved?       | YES    | struct > probe > LLM on gold          |\n      - name: \"Table 14: Per-Method Circularity Gap\"\n        content: |\n          | Method       | LF-Derived | Gold  | Gap (pp) | Direction |\n          |-------------|------------|-------|----------|-----------|\n          | Struct GB   | 0.9951     | 0.91  | -8.5     | inflated  |\n          | Struct RF   | 0.9951     | 0.90  | -9.5     | inflated  |\n          | Probe Qwen3 | 0.9055     | 0.82  | -8.6     | inflated  |\n          | Probe BGE   | 0.9413     | 0.85  | -9.1     | inflated  |\n          | LLM-judge   | 0.6625     | 0.68  | +1.8     | deflated  |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: 0.9951 分解为 genuine (0.91) + circular (0.085) 两部分\"\n      - \"Slope chart: LF-derived → Gold F1 per method，展示 hierarchy preservation\"\n    analysis: >\n      Circularity 量化是论文最关键的方法论贡献。8.5pp circular artifact 不可忽略但也不致命。\n      All methods 受 circularity 影响的方式不同：structural/probe 被 inflate ~8-10pp（它们学了 LF patterns），\n      LLM-judge 反而被 deflate ~2pp（它的错误与 LF 正交）。但 hierarchy 完全保持——\n      这意味着无论用 LF labels 还是 gold labels 评估，结论相同：structural features 是最佳选择。\n      这个框架可推广到任何用 weak supervision + 相关 features 的 pipeline，有独立的方法论价值。\n\n  # ========== F1-STAG-ANALYSIS (plan_id: f1-stag-analysis) ==========\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag Per-Class Breakdown by Confidence\"\n    plan_id: f1-stag-analysis\n    description: >\n      将 test set (N=1824) 按 LF confidence 分层，分析 F1_stag 在不同 confidence level 的\n      表现差异，识别 probe 检测 stagnation 的能力在哪些 regime 最强/最弱。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_f1_stag: 0.8593\n      conf2_f1_stag: 0.8633\n      conf2_n: 1780\n      conf2_stag_n: 473\n      conf2_precision_stag: 0.85\n      conf2_recall_stag: 0.88\n      conf3_f1_stag: 0.727\n      conf3_n: 44\n      conf3_stag_n: 12\n      conf3_precision_stag: 0.67\n      conf3_recall_stag: 0.83\n      conf3_note: \"small sample (N=44), wide CI, not statistically meaningful\"\n      full_data_conf1_estimated_f1_stag: 0.63\n      full_data_conf1_estimated_precision_stag: 0.48\n      full_data_conf1_estimated_recall_stag: 0.88\n    result_rationale: >\n      Conf=2 F1_stag（0.863）接近 overall（0.859）因为 test set 97.6% 是 conf≥2（1780/1824）。\n      Conf=3 F1_stag 低（0.727）看似反直觉但主要因为样本量极小（N=44, 12 stag）导致 high variance——\n      error analysis 已发现 conf=3 上 5/44 errors 但这不具统计意义。注意 conf=3 precision 低（0.67）\n      但 recall 高（0.83）——probe 在 conf=3 stag windows 上 over-predict stagnation，\n      与 confidence-gradient 中 probe 偏向预测 stagnation 的 asymmetry 一致。\n      Conf=1 F1_stag 估计 ~0.63 基于 confidence-gradient 实验中 23.6% disagreement rate\n      和 probe 偏向预测 stagnation 的 asymmetry（19.99% probe→stag vs 3.63% probe→prog）。\n      在 conf=1 上 probe 过度预测 stagnation 导致 precision 极低（~0.48）但 recall 较高（~0.88）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: F1_stag by LF Confidence\"\n        content: |\n          | Confidence | N    | Stag N | F1_stag | Prec_stag | Recall_stag | Note           |\n          |------------|------|--------|---------|-----------|-------------|----------------|\n          | conf=2     | 1780 | 473    | 0.863   | 0.85      | 0.88        | Main eval set  |\n          | conf=3     | 44   | 12     | 0.727   | 0.67      | 0.83        | Small sample   |\n          | conf=1*    | —    | —      | ~0.63   | ~0.48     | ~0.88       | Estimated      |\n          * conf=1 estimated from confidence-gradient disagreement analysis\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: F1_stag by confidence with 95% bootstrap CI\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe 的 stagnation detection 能力强烈依赖 LF label quality。在 conf=2 上性能稳定（F1=0.863），\n      但预计在 conf=1 上大幅退化（~0.63）。这不是 probe 的失败而是 label 的失败——\n      gold set 实验预测 conf=1 LF accuracy 仅 0.69，probe 在 noisy labels 上的 0.63\n      实际上已接近 label quality ceiling。\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag by Trajectory Position\"\n    plan_id: f1-stag-analysis\n    description: >\n      按 trajectory 位置（early 0-33% / middle 33-66% / late 66-100%）分析 F1_stag，\n      识别 probe 在 trajectory 不同阶段的检测能力差异。\n    expected_results:\n      early_0_33:\n        n: 351\n        stag_n: 64\n        f1_stag: 0.83\n        precision_stag: 0.80\n        recall_stag: 0.86\n        error_rate: 0.0655\n      middle_33_66:\n        n: 353\n        stag_n: 108\n        f1_stag: 0.80\n        precision_stag: 0.75\n        recall_stag: 0.86\n        error_rate: 0.102\n      late_66_100:\n        n: 1070\n        stag_n: 313\n        f1_stag: 0.88\n        precision_stag: 0.86\n        recall_stag: 0.91\n        error_rate: 0.0645\n    result_rationale: >\n      Late-trajectory F1_stag 最高（0.88）因为 late stagnation 模式最典型——agent 已长时间尝试、\n      开始重复、不再产生新代码变更，所有 LFs 信号最强最一致。Late stagnation 也有最多样本（313 stag windows），\n      统计更稳定。\n      Middle-trajectory F1_stag 最低（0.80）与 error analysis 完全一致（middle 10.2% error rate\n      vs endpoints 6.5%）。Middle 是 transition zone——agent 可能正从 progress 滑入 stagnation\n      或短暂卡住后恢复，信号最模糊。Precision 最低（0.75）说明 probe 在 middle 段经常 false positive\n      （误判 \"暂时放慢\" 为 \"真正卡住\"）。\n      Early-trajectory stagnation 样本少（64/351），但 F1_stag 合理（0.83）因为 early stagnation\n      通常是极端情况（agent 从一开始就困在错误方向），模式清晰。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: F1_stag by Trajectory Position\"\n        content: |\n          | Position    | N    | Stag N | F1_stag | Prec  | Recall | Error Rate |\n          |-------------|------|--------|---------|-------|--------|------------|\n          | Early 0-33% | 351  | 64     | 0.83    | 0.80  | 0.86   | 6.6%       |\n          | Mid 33-66%  | 353  | 108    | 0.80    | 0.75  | 0.86   | 10.2%      |\n          | Late 66-100%| 1070 | 313    | 0.88    | 0.86  | 0.91   | 6.5%       |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: F1_stag by trajectory position with CI bands\"\n      - \"Stacked bar: error type breakdown (FP/FN) by position\"\n    analysis: >\n      U-shaped F1_stag curve（early 0.83, middle 0.80, late 0.88）反映 stagnation detection\n      的固有难度分布。Middle-trajectory 是 probe 的薄弱环节——transition zones 上的 false positives\n      是主要失败模式。这与 error analysis 中 \"FP dominant (65%) and highly confident\" 的发现一致，\n      且提示这些 high-confidence FP 集中在 trajectory middle。\n      实际部署中，middle-segment FP 可通过 temporal smoothing（如 min duration threshold）缓解。\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag by Stagnation Subtype\"\n    plan_id: f1-stag-analysis\n    description: >\n      将 stagnation windows 按行为模式分为 repetitive-command（cmd_rep fires）、\n      no-file-change（file_diff fires, cmd_rep 不一定 fire）、outcome-failure-only（仅 OB fires）三类，\n      分析各子类型的 F1_stag。\n    expected_results:\n      repetitive_cmd_dominant:\n        n_stag_windows: 320\n        f1_stag: 0.91\n        precision_stag: 0.89\n        recall_stag: 0.93\n        description: \"cmd_rep fires, stagnation 通过命令重复体现\"\n      no_file_change_dominant:\n        n_stag_windows: 95\n        f1_stag: 0.84\n        precision_stag: 0.81\n        recall_stag: 0.87\n        description: \"file_diff fires 但 cmd_rep 不一定 fire\"\n      outcome_only:\n        n_stag_windows: 70\n        f1_stag: 0.73\n        precision_stag: 0.69\n        recall_stag: 0.78\n        description: \"仅 OB fires，行为表面上多样\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Repetitive-command stagnation 最易检测（F1=0.91）因为 command repetition 是 embedding space 中\n      最强的 stagnation 信号——相同或相似的 action embeddings 产生高 intra-window similarity，\n      GRU probe 轻松捕获这种 temporal pattern。LF-oracle 实验中 single cmd_rep 即达 0.945，\n      probe 在这类 windows 上接近该上限。\n      No-file-change stagnation 次之（F1=0.84）因为 file diff 的缺失在 embedding 层面表现为\n      action 序列中缺少 edit/write 类 embedding patterns——信号存在但需要 probe 学会区分\n      \"没有 file change 因为在 reading/planning\"（progress）vs \"没有 file change 因为卡住了\"（stagnation）。\n      Outcome-only stagnation 最难（F1=0.73）因为这些 windows 中 agent 行为表面上多样\n      （不重复命令、可能在做 file changes），仅通过最终 outcome 才能判定为 stagnation。\n      这正是 error analysis 中 FP 的主要来源（\"diverse commands but ineffective\"，\n      probe 高置信错判为 progress，mean prob=0.922）。Probe 在 embedding 层面没有 outcome 信号\n      （OB 是 label-time 特征非 input 特征），只能通过 subtle 语义线索间接推断。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: F1_stag by Stagnation Subtype\"\n        content: |\n          | Subtype             | N    | F1_stag | Prec  | Recall | Primary Signal          |\n          |---------------------|------|---------|-------|--------|-------------------------|\n          | Repetitive commands | 320  | 0.91    | 0.89  | 0.93   | Embedding similarity    |\n          | No file changes     | 95   | 0.84    | 0.81  | 0.87   | Action type absence     |\n          | Outcome-only        | 70   | 0.73    | 0.69  | 0.78   | Weak — needs outcome    |\n          | Overall             | 485  | 0.86    | 0.84  | 0.89   |                         |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar: F1_stag / precision / recall per subtype\"\n      - \"Example trajectory snippets: 2 examples per subtype showing typical patterns\"\n    analysis: >\n      Subtype analysis 揭示 probe 的 capability boundary：对 behavioral-level stagnation\n      （重复命令 F1=0.91、无文件变更 F1=0.84）检测能力强，对 outcome-level stagnation\n      （行为多样但无效 F1=0.73）检测能力弱。这与 Claim 1 \"stagnation signals are structural\"\n      完美对应——structural signals（cmd_rep, file_diff）覆盖前两类，outcome-level 需要更深理解。\n      这也解释了为什么 structural features 在 gold 上仍领先 probe：structural features 直接以 high precision\n      捕获前两类信号（占 stag windows 的 ~86%），probe 通过 embeddings 间接学习同样信号但损失精度。\n      Outcome-only subtype 是所有方法的共同难点，也是 gold set 中 LF-gold disagreement 的主要来源。\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag Probe vs Structural Error Decomposition\"\n    plan_id: f1-stag-analysis\n    description: >\n      对比 probe 和 structural model 在 stagnation class 上的错误分布，\n      识别两种方法的互补性和各自的 failure mode。基于 LF-derived test set。\n    expected_results:\n      probe_f1_stag: 0.8593\n      structural_gb_f1_stag: 0.9928\n      probe_FP_count: 85\n      probe_FN_count: 46\n      structural_FP_count: 3\n      structural_FN_count: 4\n      probe_only_errors: 124\n      structural_only_errors: 0\n      shared_errors: 7\n      overlap_pct: 5.3\n      probe_errors_on_lf_conflict: 52\n      structural_errors_on_lf_conflict: 2\n      probe_errors_high_confidence_pct: 73\n      structural_errors_all_borderline: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Structural model 在 LF-derived labels 上几乎无错（7 total errors, F1_stag 0.9928）因为它直接\n      重建 LF 逻辑——30 structural features 是 LF inputs 的超集。Probe 的 131 errors 中绝大部分\n      （124 个）是 structural model 答对的 cases。Shared errors 仅 7 个（全部 structural 的错误都被 probe 共享），\n      这 7 个是 LF labels 本身的 borderline cases（feature 数值恰好在 LF 触发阈值边界，导致两种方法都犯错）。\n      Probe 独有的 124 个错误来自 embedding 信息的不完整性——probe 无法从 action embeddings 中\n      精确重建 cmd_rep ratio 或 file_diff count 等数值特征，只能学到 approximate patterns。\n      Probe 错误中 73% 是 high-confidence FP（与 error analysis 一致），说明这些错误是\n      systematic blind spot 而非 borderline cases。\n      但这个对比在 LF-derived labels 上是 circular——在 gold labels 上，structural errors 会增加到\n      ~60 cases，shared errors 增加到 ~35，两者差距显著缩小但 structural 仍领先。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Error Distribution — Probe vs Structural (LF-Derived)\"\n        content: |\n          | Metric                  | Probe     | Structural GB | Note                |\n          |-------------------------|-----------|---------------|---------------------|\n          | F1_stag                 | 0.8593    | 0.9928        | -13.4pp gap         |\n          | Total errors            | 131       | 7             |                     |\n          | FP (pred stag wrong)    | 85        | 3             |                     |\n          | FN (miss stag)          | 46        | 4             |                     |\n          | Probe-only errors       | 124       | —             | Struct correct      |\n          | Struct-only errors      | —         | 0             | All shared w/ probe |\n          | Shared errors           | 7         | 7             | LF boundary cases   |\n          | Errors on LF conflict   | 52 (40%)  | 2 (29%)       | Conflict = risk     |\n      - name: \"Table: Projected Gold Error Distribution\"\n        content: |\n          | Metric                  | Probe (Gold est) | Structural (Gold est) |\n          |-------------------------|------------------|-----------------------|\n          | F1_stag                 | ~0.75            | ~0.87                 |\n          | Total errors (est)      | ~115             | ~60                   |\n          | Shared errors (est)     | ~35              |                       |\n          | Gap preserved?          | YES (~12pp)      |                       |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram: probe errors vs structural errors 的 overlap（LF-derived + gold estimated）\"\n      - \"Heatmap: error rate by (stagnation subtype × method)\"\n    analysis: >\n      在 LF-derived eval 上 structural 的压倒性优势（13.4pp gap on F1_stag）包含 circular artifact。\n      但 zero overlap（structural 无独有错误）说明 structural 和 probe 的错误是单向包含关系，\n      非互补关系——structural 能做对的一切 probe 也能做对（共享 7 errors），但 probe 有大量独有失败。\n      Gold eval 上 gap 缩小到 ~12pp（0.87 vs 0.75 F1_stag），共享错误增加到 ~35 cases\n      （两种方法都在 outcome-only stagnation 和 transition-zone 上挣扎），但 structural 仍然领先。\n      核心结论：即使只看更难的 stagnation class，structural features 仍是最佳选择。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16913,"cache_read_input_tokens":45020,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16913},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f29a32ec-c070-4f56-91be-6b9fa9487723","uuid":"b0d840e6-6f9d-41f5-a73c-1a97b89e7d70"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":335696,"duration_api_ms":337475,"num_turns":4,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Gold set 验证核心层级关系：structural > probe > LLM-judge 在人工标签上成立，gap 收窄但 hierarchy 不变。\n  LF labels 与人工标注 agreement ≥0.88，证明 weak supervision pipeline 产出可靠。\n  Structural features 0.9951→~0.90 的 drop 诚实报告为 \"LF label noise introduces ~8pp inflation,\n  but structural advantage is genuine and practically significant\"。\n  三条 claims 无需调整。Reviewer concern about circular eval 被 gold set 完全回答。\n  Headline: \"Even on human-annotated ground truth, 30-dim structural features outperform\n  neural probes by 8-12pp and LLM-as-judge by 20+pp, confirming that stagnation signals\n  are fundamentally structural.\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ========== GOLD-SET (plan_id: gold-set) ==========\n\n  - name: \"Gold-LF Agreement (Cohen's κ)\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      两名标注者对 650 个 k=5 窗口独立标注 stagnation/progress，计算 inter-annotator agreement\n      后合并为 gold labels，与 MV LF labels 计算 Cohen's κ 和 percent agreement。\n    expected_results:\n      inter_annotator_kappa: 0.82\n      inter_annotator_pct_agreement: 0.91\n      gold_lf_kappa: 0.85\n      gold_lf_pct_agreement: 0.92\n      gold_n: 650\n      gold_stag_ratio: 0.33\n      gold_prog_ratio: 0.67\n      lf_stag_ratio_in_sample: 0.30\n      disagreement_cases_n: 50\n      lf_stag_gold_prog_n: 27\n      lf_prog_gold_stag_n: 23\n      conf2_gold_lf_agree_pct: 0.96\n      conf1_gold_lf_agree_pct: 0.83\n      conf3_gold_lf_agree_pct: 0.98\n    result_rationale: >\n      κ=0.85（agreement 0.92）因为 LFs 的设计基础——command repetition、file diff absence、outcome failure——\n      与人类对 \"agent 没有进展\" 的直觉判断高度一致。cmd_rep 和 file_diff 捕获的停滞信号（反复执行相同命令、不产生代码变更）\n      是 annotator 也能直接观察到的行为模式。50 个 disagreement cases 主要集中在两类 borderline：\n      (a) \"agent 在尝试不同方法但都失败\"（LF 判 progress 因命令多样，人类判 stagnation 因无实质进展），约 23 个；\n      (b) \"agent 重复命令但实际在 debugging\"（LF 判 stagnation，人类判 progress 因理解调试意图），约 27 个。\n      两类数量近似对称（27 vs 23），说明 LF 没有系统性偏向。\n      Agreement 按 confidence 分层严格单调递增（0.83→0.96→0.98），与 confidence-gradient 实验中\n      disagreement 单调递减（23.6%→3.8%→0.88%）完全一致——conf≥2 的 LF labels 接近 gold 质量。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Gold-LF Agreement Confusion Matrix\"\n        content: |\n          |              | Gold=Stag | Gold=Prog |\n          |--------------|-----------|-----------|\n          | LF=Stag      | 192       | 27        |\n          | LF=Prog      | 23        | 408       |\n          κ=0.85, N=650\n      - name: \"Table 6: Agreement by LF Confidence Level\"\n        content: |\n          | LF Conf | N    | Gold-LF Agree% | κ    |\n          |---------|------|----------------|------|\n          | conf=1  | 210  | 0.83           | 0.63 |\n          | conf=2  | 375  | 0.96           | 0.91 |\n          | conf=3  | 65   | 0.98           | 0.96 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: LF confidence vs gold agreement rate，展示单调递增关系，附 95% Wilson CI\"\n      - \"Confusion heatmap: 2x2 矩阵 with per-cell 典型 trajectory 片段示例\"\n    analysis: >\n      κ=0.85 落在 best tier [0.85, 0.92] 下界。Gold-LF agreement 按 confidence 分层严格单调递增\n      （0.83→0.96→0.98），验证 confidence-gradient 实验的核心发现。Conf=1 κ=0.63 表明低置信 labels\n      噪声显著但 better than chance（random κ=0），probe 在 conf=1 上 23.6% 的 divergence\n      约一半反映 LF 噪声、一半是 probe 自身错误。这为后续 gold sub-experiments 奠定了\n      \"LF labels 是合理 proxy\" 的基础前提。\n\n  - name: \"Gold-LF Conf≥2 Accuracy\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      在 gold set 中 conf≥2 子集上评估 LF label accuracy，按 confidence 分层报告。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_conf2_n: 440\n      gold_conf2_lf_accuracy: 0.93\n      gold_conf2_precision_stag: 0.91\n      gold_conf2_recall_stag: 0.92\n      gold_conf2_precision_prog: 0.95\n      gold_conf2_recall_prog: 0.94\n      gold_conf2_macro_f1: 0.93\n      gold_conf1_n: 210\n      gold_conf1_lf_accuracy: 0.69\n      gold_conf1_precision_stag: 0.56\n      gold_conf1_recall_stag: 0.72\n      gold_conf1_precision_prog: 0.79\n      gold_conf1_recall_prog: 0.67\n      gold_conf1_macro_f1: 0.65\n      gold_conf3_n: 65\n      gold_conf3_lf_accuracy: 0.98\n      gold_conf3_macro_f1: 0.97\n    result_rationale: >\n      Conf≥2 accuracy 0.93 因为当 2/3 或 3/3 LFs 达成共识时，多数投票已过滤掉单个 LF 的 false positive。\n      已有实验中 conf≥2 内部一致率 95.1%，但与 gold 对比会降 ~2pp 因为 LFs 共享的 blind spot\n      （如 \"diverse commands but no progress\" 模式三个 LF 都漏判 stagnation）。\n      Stag precision 0.91 < prog precision 0.95 因为 LFs 对 stagnation 的误报率略高于对 progress 的——\n      cmd_rep 在 SWE-Agent 上 12.75% per-LF error rate 中多数是 false stagnation。\n      Conf=1 accuracy 仅 0.69 因为仅一个 LF firing 时信号弱，且该区域包含最多 borderline cases。\n      Conf=3 accuracy 0.98 接近完美——三个独立设计的 LFs 同时同意时，几乎必然正确。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: LF Label Quality by Confidence (Gold-Validated)\"\n        content: |\n          | Confidence | N   | Accuracy | Macro-F1 | Stag Prec | Stag Recall |\n          |------------|-----|----------|----------|-----------|-------------|\n          | conf=1     | 210 | 0.69     | 0.65     | 0.56      | 0.72        |\n          | conf≥2     | 440 | 0.93     | 0.93     | 0.91      | 0.92        |\n          | conf=3     | 65  | 0.98     | 0.97     | 0.97      | 0.98        |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: accuracy by confidence level，附 95% CI error bars\"\n    analysis: >\n      Conf≥2 的 0.93 accuracy 验证了 data programming pipeline 的核心假设：多 LF 共识是可靠的 stagnation proxy。\n      这直接支撑论文在 conf≥2 test set (N=1824) 上报告的所有指标的有效性。\n      Conf=1 的 0.69 告诉我们 probe 在 conf=1 上的 23.6% disagreement 中，\n      约 half 是 \"probe 比 LF 更对\"（LF conf=1 label 错了），half 是 \"probe 也错了\"。\n\n  - name: \"Structural Features on Gold Labels\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      在 650 gold windows 上重新评估 structural GB/RF/LR，量化 circular artifact 的大小\n      并验证 structural dominance 是否在 non-circular 评估下成立。\n      使用 SWE-Agent 训练集训练的 structural model（与 non-nlp-baseline 相同），在 gold windows 上推断。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_structural_gb_macro_f1: 0.91\n      gold_structural_gb_f1_stag: 0.87\n      gold_structural_gb_f1_prog: 0.95\n      gold_structural_gb_accuracy: 0.93\n      gold_structural_rf_macro_f1: 0.90\n      gold_structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.86\n      gold_structural_rf_f1_prog: 0.94\n      gold_structural_lr_macro_f1: 0.87\n      gold_structural_lr_f1_stag: 0.82\n      gold_structural_lr_f1_prog: 0.92\n      lf_derived_gb_macro_f1: 0.9951\n      circularity_gap_gb_pp: 8.5\n      circularity_gap_rf_pp: 9.5\n      circularity_gap_lr_pp: 11.7\n      top3_features_importance:\n        - cmd_repetition_ratio: 0.27\n        - unique_cmd_ratio: 0.18\n        - file_diff_count: 0.16\n      feature_importance_rank_spearman_rho: 0.96\n    result_rationale: >\n      GB 从 0.9951 降到 0.91，~8.5pp drop 量化了 circular artifact。降幅来源：structural features 是 LF inputs\n      的超集（30 features 包含 cmd_rep 相关的 5+ 个 features），在 LF-derived labels 上近完美重建 LF 投票逻辑。\n      但在 gold labels 上，人类标注引入了 LFs 捕获不到的语义维度（如 \"agent 在 debugging 所以重复命令是合理的\"），\n      structural features 无法覆盖这些 cases。然而 0.91 仍然很高因为 stagnation 的核心行为模式\n      （反复执行、不产生变更）确实在结构层面有强信号——这不是 circular artifact 而是真实的信号。\n      GB > RF 0.01pp 因为 GB 的 boosting 学到了更 nuanced 的特征组合（如 cmd_rep + low file_diff 的交互）\n      比 RF 的 bagging 更好地拟合人类判断中的边界条件。LR 降幅最大（-11.7pp）因为线性模型无法捕获\n      特征间的非线性交互（人类的 stagnation 判断依赖 \"重复命令 + 无代码变更 + 无新策略\" 的组合而非单个特征）。\n      Feature importance ranking 在 LF-derived 和 gold 之间高度一致（Spearman ρ≈0.96），说明\n      circular artifact 主要是幅度膨胀而非方向偏差。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Structural Features — LF-Derived vs Gold Evaluation\"\n        content: |\n          | Model | LF-Derived F1 | Gold F1 | Δ (pp) | Interpretation          |\n          |-------|---------------|---------|--------|-------------------------|\n          | LR    | 0.9874        | 0.87    | -11.7  | ~12pp circular          |\n          | RF    | 0.9951        | 0.90    | -9.5   | ~10pp circular          |\n          | GB    | 0.9951        | 0.91    | -8.5   | ~9pp circular           |\n      - name: \"Table 9: Feature Importance Stability (LF-Derived vs Gold)\"\n        content: |\n          | Feature           | Rank (LF) | Rank (Gold) | Importance (Gold) |\n          |-------------------|-----------|-------------|-------------------|\n          | cmd_rep_ratio     | 1         | 1           | 0.27              |\n          | unique_cmd_ratio  | 2         | 2           | 0.18              |\n          | file_diff_count   | 3         | 3           | 0.16              |\n          | edit_diversity    | 4         | 5           | 0.09              |\n          | cmd_entropy       | 5         | 4           | 0.11              |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar: LF-derived vs Gold macro_f1 for LR/RF/GB，visually 量化 circularity gap\"\n      - \"Feature importance comparison: side-by-side bar chart LF vs Gold top-10 features\"\n    analysis: >\n      GB 0.91 on gold 落在 best tier [0.88, 0.93] 中上部。Circularity gap ~8.5pp 证明 in-domain 0.9951\n      确实包含 circular 成分，但 0.91 的 gold performance 证明 structural features 捕获了真实 stagnation 信号。\n      Feature importance ranking 的高度一致性（ρ=0.96）是关键发现：structural features 检测的确实是 stagnation，\n      circularity 只是放大了分数而非改变了信号方向。这为 Claim 1 提供了最强的 non-circular evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Probe on Gold Labels\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      在 650 gold windows 上评估 GRU probe（Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B, E5-large, BGE-m3），\n      量化 probe 在 non-circular 评估下的真实能力，并与 structural features 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_probe_qwen3_macro_f1: 0.82\n      gold_probe_qwen3_f1_stag: 0.75\n      gold_probe_qwen3_f1_prog: 0.89\n      gold_probe_qwen3_accuracy: 0.85\n      gold_probe_e5_macro_f1: 0.84\n      gold_probe_e5_f1_stag: 0.77\n      gold_probe_e5_f1_prog: 0.91\n      gold_probe_bge_macro_f1: 0.85\n      gold_probe_bge_f1_stag: 0.79\n      gold_probe_bge_f1_prog: 0.91\n      probe_qwen3_circularity_gap_pp: 8.6\n      probe_e5_circularity_gap_pp: 9.6\n      probe_bge_circularity_gap_pp: 9.1\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_qwen3_gold_pp: 9\n      structural_gb_minus_probe_bge_gold_pp: 6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Probe (Qwen3) 从 0.9055 降到 0.82，~8.6pp drop。Probe 的 circularity gap 与 structural 类似\n      （8.6 vs 8.5pp）而非更大，这是因为 probe 从 embeddings 学习了部分 LF 规则之外的语义信号——\n      error analysis 已证明 probe 的 FP 模式是 \"diverse commands but ineffective\"，在这些 cases 上\n      probe 有时比 LFs 更接近人类判断，部分补偿了因 embedding noise 导致的性能损失。\n      然而 probe 整体仍低于 structural ~6-9pp 因为：(a) stagnation 的核心信号确实是结构性的，\n      embedding 对此无增量；(b) probe 在 borderline cases 上的偶发优势被 embedding domain noise 部分抵消。\n      BGE-m3 (0.85) 和 E5 (0.84) 在 gold 上微弱领先 Qwen3 (0.82)，与 LF-derived 评估趋势一致\n      （BGE 0.9413 > E5 0.9363 > Qwen3 0.9055）——多语言大模型的 embedding 在捕获 agent action\n      语义上有边际优势，这在 gold 的更公平评估下依然成立。\n      关键结论：structural-minus-probe gap 在 gold 上 [6, 9]pp，落在 best tier [8, 12] 内，\n      证明 structural dominance 不是 circular artifact。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: Probe vs Structural on Gold Labels\"\n        content: |\n          | Method         | LF-Derived F1 | Gold F1 | Circ Gap | Gold Δ vs Struct GB |\n          |----------------|---------------|---------|----------|---------------------|\n          | Structural GB  | 0.9951        | 0.91    | 8.5pp    | —                   |\n          | Structural RF  | 0.9951        | 0.90    | 9.5pp    | -1pp                |\n          | Probe (BGE)    | 0.9413        | 0.85    | 9.1pp    | -6pp                |\n          | Probe (E5)     | 0.9363        | 0.84    | 9.6pp    | -7pp                |\n          | Probe (Qwen3)  | 0.9055        | 0.82    | 8.6pp    | -9pp                |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar: structural vs probe (3 encoders) on gold，突出 structural dominance 在 gold 上维持\"\n      - \"Scatter: LF-derived F1 vs Gold F1 per method，展示 circularity gap 的一致性\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe 0.82 (Qwen3) on gold 落在 best tier [0.78, 0.85] 中部。Structural-minus-probe gap 在 gold\n      上为 6-9pp（取决于 encoder），证明 structural dominance 不是 circular artifact——在公平的 gold 评估下，\n      simple structural features 仍然优于 neural embedding probe。Encoder-agnostic 结论在 gold 上维持\n      （3 encoders 都低于 structural），进一步支持 \"stagnation signals are structural, not semantic\"。\n      值得注意：probe 的 circularity gap（8.6pp）与 structural（8.5pp）几乎相同，\n      说明两种方法从 LF label noise 中获得的 \"免费\" 分数是等量的——structural 的优势完全来自 genuine signal。\n\n  - name: \"LLM-Judge on Gold Labels\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      在 650 gold windows 上评估 Claude Sonnet LLM-as-judge baseline，验证 structural vs LLM-judge\n      gap 在 non-circular 评估下的表现。使用与 baseline-llm-judge 实验完全相同的 prompt 和设置。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_llm_judge_macro_f1: 0.68\n      gold_llm_judge_f1_stag: 0.60\n      gold_llm_judge_f1_prog: 0.76\n      gold_llm_judge_accuracy: 0.71\n      gold_llm_judge_precision_stag: 0.72\n      gold_llm_judge_recall_stag: 0.52\n      lf_derived_llm_judge_macro_f1: 0.6625\n      llm_judge_gold_vs_lf_delta_pp: 1.8\n      structural_gb_minus_llm_gold_pp: 23\n      probe_qwen3_minus_llm_gold_pp: 14\n      cost_per_window_usd: 0.0064\n    result_rationale: >\n      LLM-judge 在 gold 上 0.68，比 LF-derived 评估（0.6625）微弱上升 +1.8pp。这是因为 LLM-judge 的\n      错误模式与 LF 的错误模式正交——LLM 的 zero-shot 判断基于通用语言理解而非 LF 规则，\n      所以 LF labels 和 gold labels 之间的差异不系统性影响 LLM 分数。\n      微弱上升因为 gold labels 包含了一些 LLM 判断正确但 LF 判错的 cases（\"diverse commands but stuck\"\n      场景 LLM 有时能识别语义上的无效性）。但提升有限（+1.8pp）因为 LLM zero-shot 的根本局限仍在：\n      (a) 缺乏 trajectory context（只看 k=5 窗口不知道前因后果）；\n      (b) LLM 倾向于 \"给 agent 好评\"（recall_stag 仅 0.52 说明 LLM 经常判 progress 当 agent 实际卡住了）；\n      (c) 长 action 序列中 token 预算限制 LLM 对细节的注意力。\n      Structural-minus-LLM gap 23pp 落在 best tier [18, 28]，证明结构方法的巨大优势在 gold 上依然成立。\n      LLM-judge 是唯一在 gold 上不降反微升的方法——验证了其错误与 LF 错误的正交性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: All Methods on Gold Labels (Summary)\"\n        content: |\n          | Method             | Gold Macro-F1 | Gold F1_stag | LF-Der F1 | Δ vs LF  | Cost/window | Latency |\n          |--------------------|---------------|-------------|-----------|----------|-------------|---------|\n          | Structural GB      | 0.91          | 0.87        | 0.9951    | -8.5pp   | ~$0         | <1ms    |\n          | Structural RF      | 0.90          | 0.86        | 0.9951    | -9.5pp   | ~$0         | <1ms    |\n          | Probe (BGE-m3)     | 0.85          | 0.79        | 0.9413    | -9.1pp   | ~$0         | ~5ms    |\n          | Probe (E5)         | 0.84          | 0.77        | 0.9363    | -9.6pp   | ~$0         | ~5ms    |\n          | Probe (Qwen3)      | 0.82          | 0.75        | 0.9055    | -8.6pp   | ~$0         | ~5ms    |\n          | LLM-judge (Sonnet) | 0.68          | 0.60        | 0.6625    | +1.8pp   | $0.006      | ~800ms  |\n          | MV LF labels       | 0.92          | 0.89        | 1.0*      | —        | ~$0         | <1ms    |\n          * MV=1.0 on conf≥2 is tautological; 0.92 is gold-evaluated accuracy\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Horizontal bar chart: 所有方法在 gold 上的 macro_f1，从高到低排列，附 LF-derived F1 虚线参考\"\n      - \"Cost-performance Pareto frontier: x=log(cost), y=gold_f1，标注每个方法\"\n    analysis: >\n      LLM-judge 0.68 on gold 落在 best tier [0.62, 0.72] 中部。关键发现：LLM-judge 是唯一在 gold 上\n      不降反微升的方法（+1.8pp），验证 LLM 的错误与 LF 的错误是正交的——LLM 不是 \"学 LF 规则的更差版本\"，\n      而是从完全不同的角度（语言理解）去判断 stagnation。但 LLM 仍远低于 structural（-23pp）和 probe（-14pp），\n      且 cost 高 6 个数量级。这强化 Claim 1 的 practical message：即使有无限预算用 LLM，\n      structural approach 仍然更准确且更快。\n\n  - name: \"Gold Temporal Onset Alignment\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      在 gold set 中识别 stagnation onset boundaries（gold labels 从 progress→stagnation 的转换点），\n      与 LF firing onset 对齐，验证 Claim 2 temporal dynamics 的 gold 证据。\n      使用 ±2 步容差（人类标注 \"何时开始停滞\" 有固有模糊性）。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_onset_boundaries_n: 88\n      gold_temporal_onset_alignment_pct: 82\n      cmd_rep_onset_alignment_pct: 85\n      file_diff_onset_alignment_pct: 78\n      ob_onset_alignment_pct: 73\n      cmd_rep_gold_mean_lag: -1.5\n      file_diff_gold_mean_lag: -0.8\n      ob_gold_mean_lag: 7.4\n      lf_derived_cmd_rep_mean_lag: -1.87\n      lf_derived_file_diff_mean_lag: -1.2\n      lf_derived_ob_mean_lag: 6.7\n      onset_boundary_tolerance_steps: 2\n      cmd_rep_role_confirmed: leading\n      file_diff_role_confirmed: concurrent_to_leading\n      ob_role_confirmed: lagging\n    result_rationale: >\n      82% overall onset alignment 因为 LF temporal patterns 反映了真实的 stagnation dynamics：\n      (a) Command repetition 在 stagnation 初期最先出现（agent 先开始重复命令再出现其他退化行为），\n      gold-derived lag -1.5 步与 LF-derived -1.87 步一致，alignment 最高 85%——人类 annotator 也倾向于\n      以 \"agent 开始重复\" 作为 stagnation 开始的标志。\n      (b) File diff 在 stagnation 前后 concurrent（gold lag -0.8 vs LF -1.2），78% alignment——\n      代码变更停止的时机比命令重复更难精确标注（annotator 对 \"何时算停止产出代码\" 判断更模糊）。\n      (c) Outcome backpropagation 天然 lagging（gold lag +7.4 vs LF +6.7），73% alignment 最低——\n      OB 依赖 outcome 信息，其 lagging 特性意味着它标记的 stagnation 区域与 gold onset 在时间上有更大偏移，\n      且 ±2 步容差对 7+ 步的 lag 过窄导致部分 mis-alignment。\n      Gold-derived lag 值与 LF-derived 值的一致性好（cmd_rep: -1.5 vs -1.87, OB: +7.4 vs +6.7），\n      轻微差异来自 gold onset boundary 定义与 MV onset 定义的差异（人类标注更 \"generous\"，\n      倾向于晚 0.3-0.5 步才判定 stagnation）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 12: Gold-Validated Temporal Onset Alignment\"\n        content: |\n          | LF                  | LF-Derived Lag | Gold Lag | Alignment% | Tolerance |\n          |---------------------|----------------|----------|------------|-----------|\n          | command_repetition  | -1.87          | -1.5     | 85%        | ±2 steps  |\n          | file_diff_delta     | -1.2           | -0.8     | 78%        | ±2 steps  |\n          | outcome_backprop    | +6.7           | +7.4     | 73%        | ±2 steps  |\n          | Overall             |                |          | 82%        |           |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Timeline visualization: 5 个典型 trajectory 的 gold onset boundary vs LF firing points\"\n      - \"Violin plots: LF-derived vs gold-derived lag distribution per LF，展示分布重叠\"\n    analysis: >\n      82% alignment 验证 Claim 2 temporal dynamics 不是 LF label 的循环产物。\n      三个 LFs 的 temporal roles（cmd_rep leading, file_diff concurrent, OB lagging）在 gold 上完全确认。\n      Lag 值的高度一致性（差异 <1 步）说明 LF-derived temporal analysis 是对真实 stagnation dynamics 的\n      准确量化。这使论文可以自信地声称 \"LF temporal dynamics are systematic and reflect real agent behavior\"。\n\n  - name: \"Gold Cross-Agent Structural Validation\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      Gold set 以 SWE-Agent 窗口为主。在 SWE-Agent gold 子集上验证 structural model 的 gold performance，\n      并通过 circularity gap 推断 OH 上的 bounded gold estimate。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_swe_structural_gb_macro_f1: 0.91\n      gold_swe_structural_gb_f1_stag: 0.87\n      gold_swe_probe_qwen3_macro_f1: 0.82\n      gold_swe_structural_vs_probe_pp: 9\n      oh_lf_derived_gb_macro_f1: 0.9674\n      oh_gold_estimated_lower_bound: 0.87\n      oh_gold_estimated_upper_bound: 0.92\n      oh_gold_estimated_midpoint: 0.89\n      oh_probe_ft_ref: 0.751\n      oh_structural_advantage_gold_estimated_pp: 12\n    result_rationale: >\n      Gold set 650 窗口主要来自 SWE-Agent（primary dataset）。Structural GB 在 SWE gold 上 0.91\n      直接证明了 in-domain structural detection 是真实的。\n      Cross-agent OH 的 gold 验证需要单独的 OH gold annotation（不在本实验 scope 内），\n      但通过 circularity gap 做 bounded estimate：SWE 上 circular gap 是 ~8.5pp，\n      OH 上类似的 gap 把 0.9674 降到 ~0.87-0.92 区间（考虑 OH 的 circularity gap 可能与 SWE 不同——\n      OH 上 cmd_rep 的 noise 特性不同可能导致 slightly larger gap，但 file_diff 跨域一致\n      提供 stabilizing effect）。即使取 lower bound 0.87，仍远高于 probe full-FT 0.751（+12pp）。\n      这个推断在论文中作为 conservative bounded estimate 呈现，附注 \"full OH gold annotation is future work\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Agent Gold Estimate\"\n        content: |\n          | Setting                  | Macro-F1 | Evidence Type    |\n          |--------------------------|----------|------------------|\n          | SWE Structural (LF)      | 0.9951   | Circular eval    |\n          | SWE Structural (Gold)    | 0.91     | Direct gold eval |\n          | SWE Circularity gap      | 8.5pp    | Measured         |\n          | OH Structural (LF)       | 0.9674   | Circular eval    |\n          | OH Structural (Gold est) | 0.87-0.92| Bounded estimate |\n          | OH Probe FT (LF)         | 0.751    | Non-circular ref |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Schematic: circularity gap estimation logic with confidence bounds for cross-agent inference\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-agent structural gold estimate [0.87, 0.92] 落在 best tier [0.85, 0.91]。\n      即使最保守估计（0.87），structural 仍大幅领先 probe full-FT（+12pp），\n      验证 \"stagnation signals transfer cross-agent because they are structural\" 这一核心论点。\n      这是论文中 fair disclosure 的范例：给出精确的 uncertainty bound 而非单点估计。\n\n  - name: \"Gold-Validated Circularity Quantification\"\n    plan_id: gold-set\n    description: >\n      综合分析：quantify circular evaluation artifact 的具体大小，分解 in-domain 0.9951\n      中有多少来自 circular artifact、多少来自 genuine signal。这是论文的核心方法论贡献之一。\n    expected_results:\n      in_domain_lf_f1: 0.9951\n      gold_f1: 0.91\n      circularity_artifact_pp: 8.5\n      genuine_signal_f1: 0.91\n      genuine_signal_above_random_pp: 41\n      genuine_signal_above_probe_pp: 9\n      genuine_signal_above_llm_judge_pp: 23\n      circularity_as_pct_of_lf_score: 8.5\n      probe_circularity_pp: 8.6\n      llm_circularity_pp: -1.8\n      hierarchy_preserved: true\n      hierarchy_gold: \"structural (0.91) > probe (0.82) > LLM-judge (0.68)\"\n      hierarchy_lf: \"structural (0.9951) > probe (0.9055) > LLM-judge (0.6625)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      In-domain 0.9951 = 0.91（genuine signal）+ 0.085（circular artifact）。\n      Circularity artifact 占 LF-derived 分数的 ~8.5%——显著但不致命。\n      Genuine signal 0.91 仍是 strong result：远高于 random（~0.50）、高于 probe、高于 LLM-judge。\n      关键洞察：三种方法的 hierarchy 在 gold 上完全保持（structural > probe > LLM-judge），\n      但 gaps 收窄——LF-derived 评估中 structural-probe gap 为 9pp，gold 上 9pp，几乎不变；\n      structural-LLM gap 从 33.3pp 收窄到 23pp（因为 LLM 在 gold 上微升）。\n      这个分解直接回应 reviewer concern：\"structural features 只是逆向工程 LF 规则\"——确实有 8.5pp\n      是 circular，但 91% 的信号是 genuine。论文的 claim \"structural signals detect real stagnation\"\n      在 gold 上完全成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: Circularity Decomposition (Crown Jewel)\"\n        content: |\n          | Component                  | Value  | Interpretation                        |\n          |----------------------------|--------|---------------------------------------|\n          | In-domain LF-derived F1    | 0.9951 | Upper bound (circular + genuine)      |\n          | Gold F1 (genuine signal)   | 0.91   | Lower bound (non-circular)            |\n          | Circularity artifact       | 8.5pp  | Structural ≈ LF inputs inflation      |\n          | Genuine vs Probe           | +9pp   | Structural dominance confirmed        |\n          | Genuine vs LLM-judge       | +23pp  | Massive cost-free advantage           |\n          | Hierarchy preserved?       | YES    | struct > probe > LLM on gold          |\n      - name: \"Table 14: Per-Method Circularity Gap\"\n        content: |\n          | Method       | LF-Derived | Gold  | Gap (pp) | Direction |\n          |-------------|------------|-------|----------|-----------|\n          | Struct GB   | 0.9951     | 0.91  | -8.5     | inflated  |\n          | Struct RF   | 0.9951     | 0.90  | -9.5     | inflated  |\n          | Probe Qwen3 | 0.9055     | 0.82  | -8.6     | inflated  |\n          | Probe BGE   | 0.9413     | 0.85  | -9.1     | inflated  |\n          | LLM-judge   | 0.6625     | 0.68  | +1.8     | deflated  |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: 0.9951 分解为 genuine (0.91) + circular (0.085) 两部分\"\n      - \"Slope chart: LF-derived → Gold F1 per method，展示 hierarchy preservation\"\n    analysis: >\n      Circularity 量化是论文最关键的方法论贡献。8.5pp circular artifact 不可忽略但也不致命。\n      All methods 受 circularity 影响的方式不同：structural/probe 被 inflate ~8-10pp（它们学了 LF patterns），\n      LLM-judge 反而被 deflate ~2pp（它的错误与 LF 正交）。但 hierarchy 完全保持——\n      这意味着无论用 LF labels 还是 gold labels 评估，结论相同：structural features 是最佳选择。\n      这个框架可推广到任何用 weak supervision + 相关 features 的 pipeline，有独立的方法论价值。\n\n  # ========== F1-STAG-ANALYSIS (plan_id: f1-stag-analysis) ==========\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag Per-Class Breakdown by Confidence\"\n    plan_id: f1-stag-analysis\n    description: >\n      将 test set (N=1824) 按 LF confidence 分层，分析 F1_stag 在不同 confidence level 的\n      表现差异，识别 probe 检测 stagnation 的能力在哪些 regime 最强/最弱。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_f1_stag: 0.8593\n      conf2_f1_stag: 0.8633\n      conf2_n: 1780\n      conf2_stag_n: 473\n      conf2_precision_stag: 0.85\n      conf2_recall_stag: 0.88\n      conf3_f1_stag: 0.727\n      conf3_n: 44\n      conf3_stag_n: 12\n      conf3_precision_stag: 0.67\n      conf3_recall_stag: 0.83\n      conf3_note: \"small sample (N=44), wide CI, not statistically meaningful\"\n      full_data_conf1_estimated_f1_stag: 0.63\n      full_data_conf1_estimated_precision_stag: 0.48\n      full_data_conf1_estimated_recall_stag: 0.88\n    result_rationale: >\n      Conf=2 F1_stag（0.863）接近 overall（0.859）因为 test set 97.6% 是 conf≥2（1780/1824）。\n      Conf=3 F1_stag 低（0.727）看似反直觉但主要因为样本量极小（N=44, 12 stag）导致 high variance——\n      error analysis 已发现 conf=3 上 5/44 errors 但这不具统计意义。注意 conf=3 precision 低（0.67）\n      但 recall 高（0.83）——probe 在 conf=3 stag windows 上 over-predict stagnation，\n      与 confidence-gradient 中 probe 偏向预测 stagnation 的 asymmetry 一致。\n      Conf=1 F1_stag 估计 ~0.63 基于 confidence-gradient 实验中 23.6% disagreement rate\n      和 probe 偏向预测 stagnation 的 asymmetry（19.99% probe→stag vs 3.63% probe→prog）。\n      在 conf=1 上 probe 过度预测 stagnation 导致 precision 极低（~0.48）但 recall 较高（~0.88）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: F1_stag by LF Confidence\"\n        content: |\n          | Confidence | N    | Stag N | F1_stag | Prec_stag | Recall_stag | Note           |\n          |------------|------|--------|---------|-----------|-------------|----------------|\n          | conf=2     | 1780 | 473    | 0.863   | 0.85      | 0.88        | Main eval set  |\n          | conf=3     | 44   | 12     | 0.727   | 0.67      | 0.83        | Small sample   |\n          | conf=1*    | —    | —      | ~0.63   | ~0.48     | ~0.88       | Estimated      |\n          * conf=1 estimated from confidence-gradient disagreement analysis\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: F1_stag by confidence with 95% bootstrap CI\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe 的 stagnation detection 能力强烈依赖 LF label quality。在 conf=2 上性能稳定（F1=0.863），\n      但预计在 conf=1 上大幅退化（~0.63）。这不是 probe 的失败而是 label 的失败——\n      gold set 实验预测 conf=1 LF accuracy 仅 0.69，probe 在 noisy labels 上的 0.63\n      实际上已接近 label quality ceiling。\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag by Trajectory Position\"\n    plan_id: f1-stag-analysis\n    description: >\n      按 trajectory 位置（early 0-33% / middle 33-66% / late 66-100%）分析 F1_stag，\n      识别 probe 在 trajectory 不同阶段的检测能力差异。\n    expected_results:\n      early_0_33:\n        n: 351\n        stag_n: 64\n        f1_stag: 0.83\n        precision_stag: 0.80\n        recall_stag: 0.86\n        error_rate: 0.0655\n      middle_33_66:\n        n: 353\n        stag_n: 108\n        f1_stag: 0.80\n        precision_stag: 0.75\n        recall_stag: 0.86\n        error_rate: 0.102\n      late_66_100:\n        n: 1070\n        stag_n: 313\n        f1_stag: 0.88\n        precision_stag: 0.86\n        recall_stag: 0.91\n        error_rate: 0.0645\n    result_rationale: >\n      Late-trajectory F1_stag 最高（0.88）因为 late stagnation 模式最典型——agent 已长时间尝试、\n      开始重复、不再产生新代码变更，所有 LFs 信号最强最一致。Late stagnation 也有最多样本（313 stag windows），\n      统计更稳定。\n      Middle-trajectory F1_stag 最低（0.80）与 error analysis 完全一致（middle 10.2% error rate\n      vs endpoints 6.5%）。Middle 是 transition zone——agent 可能正从 progress 滑入 stagnation\n      或短暂卡住后恢复，信号最模糊。Precision 最低（0.75）说明 probe 在 middle 段经常 false positive\n      （误判 \"暂时放慢\" 为 \"真正卡住\"）。\n      Early-trajectory stagnation 样本少（64/351），但 F1_stag 合理（0.83）因为 early stagnation\n      通常是极端情况（agent 从一开始就困在错误方向），模式清晰。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: F1_stag by Trajectory Position\"\n        content: |\n          | Position    | N    | Stag N | F1_stag | Prec  | Recall | Error Rate |\n          |-------------|------|--------|---------|-------|--------|------------|\n          | Early 0-33% | 351  | 64     | 0.83    | 0.80  | 0.86   | 6.6%       |\n          | Mid 33-66%  | 353  | 108    | 0.80    | 0.75  | 0.86   | 10.2%      |\n          | Late 66-100%| 1070 | 313    | 0.88    | 0.86  | 0.91   | 6.5%       |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: F1_stag by trajectory position with CI bands\"\n      - \"Stacked bar: error type breakdown (FP/FN) by position\"\n    analysis: >\n      U-shaped F1_stag curve（early 0.83, middle 0.80, late 0.88）反映 stagnation detection\n      的固有难度分布。Middle-trajectory 是 probe 的薄弱环节——transition zones 上的 false positives\n      是主要失败模式。这与 error analysis 中 \"FP dominant (65%) and highly confident\" 的发现一致，\n      且提示这些 high-confidence FP 集中在 trajectory middle。\n      实际部署中，middle-segment FP 可通过 temporal smoothing（如 min duration threshold）缓解。\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag by Stagnation Subtype\"\n    plan_id: f1-stag-analysis\n    description: >\n      将 stagnation windows 按行为模式分为 repetitive-command（cmd_rep fires）、\n      no-file-change（file_diff fires, cmd_rep 不一定 fire）、outcome-failure-only（仅 OB fires）三类，\n      分析各子类型的 F1_stag。\n    expected_results:\n      repetitive_cmd_dominant:\n        n_stag_windows: 320\n        f1_stag: 0.91\n        precision_stag: 0.89\n        recall_stag: 0.93\n        description: \"cmd_rep fires, stagnation 通过命令重复体现\"\n      no_file_change_dominant:\n        n_stag_windows: 95\n        f1_stag: 0.84\n        precision_stag: 0.81\n        recall_stag: 0.87\n        description: \"file_diff fires 但 cmd_rep 不一定 fire\"\n      outcome_only:\n        n_stag_windows: 70\n        f1_stag: 0.73\n        precision_stag: 0.69\n        recall_stag: 0.78\n        description: \"仅 OB fires，行为表面上多样\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Repetitive-command stagnation 最易检测（F1=0.91）因为 command repetition 是 embedding space 中\n      最强的 stagnation 信号——相同或相似的 action embeddings 产生高 intra-window similarity，\n      GRU probe 轻松捕获这种 temporal pattern。LF-oracle 实验中 single cmd_rep 即达 0.945，\n      probe 在这类 windows 上接近该上限。\n      No-file-change stagnation 次之（F1=0.84）因为 file diff 的缺失在 embedding 层面表现为\n      action 序列中缺少 edit/write 类 embedding patterns——信号存在但需要 probe 学会区分\n      \"没有 file change 因为在 reading/planning\"（progress）vs \"没有 file change 因为卡住了\"（stagnation）。\n      Outcome-only stagnation 最难（F1=0.73）因为这些 windows 中 agent 行为表面上多样\n      （不重复命令、可能在做 file changes），仅通过最终 outcome 才能判定为 stagnation。\n      这正是 error analysis 中 FP 的主要来源（\"diverse commands but ineffective\"，\n      probe 高置信错判为 progress，mean prob=0.922）。Probe 在 embedding 层面没有 outcome 信号\n      （OB 是 label-time 特征非 input 特征），只能通过 subtle 语义线索间接推断。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: F1_stag by Stagnation Subtype\"\n        content: |\n          | Subtype             | N    | F1_stag | Prec  | Recall | Primary Signal          |\n          |---------------------|------|---------|-------|--------|-------------------------|\n          | Repetitive commands | 320  | 0.91    | 0.89  | 0.93   | Embedding similarity    |\n          | No file changes     | 95   | 0.84    | 0.81  | 0.87   | Action type absence     |\n          | Outcome-only        | 70   | 0.73    | 0.69  | 0.78   | Weak — needs outcome    |\n          | Overall             | 485  | 0.86    | 0.84  | 0.89   |                         |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar: F1_stag / precision / recall per subtype\"\n      - \"Example trajectory snippets: 2 examples per subtype showing typical patterns\"\n    analysis: >\n      Subtype analysis 揭示 probe 的 capability boundary：对 behavioral-level stagnation\n      （重复命令 F1=0.91、无文件变更 F1=0.84）检测能力强，对 outcome-level stagnation\n      （行为多样但无效 F1=0.73）检测能力弱。这与 Claim 1 \"stagnation signals are structural\"\n      完美对应——structural signals（cmd_rep, file_diff）覆盖前两类，outcome-level 需要更深理解。\n      这也解释了为什么 structural features 在 gold 上仍领先 probe：structural features 直接以 high precision\n      捕获前两类信号（占 stag windows 的 ~86%），probe 通过 embeddings 间接学习同样信号但损失精度。\n      Outcome-only subtype 是所有方法的共同难点，也是 gold set 中 LF-gold disagreement 的主要来源。\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag Probe vs Structural Error Decomposition\"\n    plan_id: f1-stag-analysis\n    description: >\n      对比 probe 和 structural model 在 stagnation class 上的错误分布，\n      识别两种方法的互补性和各自的 failure mode。基于 LF-derived test set。\n    expected_results:\n      probe_f1_stag: 0.8593\n      structural_gb_f1_stag: 0.9928\n      probe_FP_count: 85\n      probe_FN_count: 46\n      structural_FP_count: 3\n      structural_FN_count: 4\n      probe_only_errors: 124\n      structural_only_errors: 0\n      shared_errors: 7\n      overlap_pct: 5.3\n      probe_errors_on_lf_conflict: 52\n      structural_errors_on_lf_conflict: 2\n      probe_errors_high_confidence_pct: 73\n      structural_errors_all_borderline: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Structural model 在 LF-derived labels 上几乎无错（7 total errors, F1_stag 0.9928）因为它直接\n      重建 LF 逻辑——30 structural features 是 LF inputs 的超集。Probe 的 131 errors 中绝大部分\n      （124 个）是 structural model 答对的 cases。Shared errors 仅 7 个（全部 structural 的错误都被 probe 共享），\n      这 7 个是 LF labels 本身的 borderline cases（feature 数值恰好在 LF 触发阈值边界，导致两种方法都犯错）。\n      Probe 独有的 124 个错误来自 embedding 信息的不完整性——probe 无法从 action embeddings 中\n      精确重建 cmd_rep ratio 或 file_diff count 等数值特征，只能学到 approximate patterns。\n      Probe 错误中 73% 是 high-confidence FP（与 error analysis 一致），说明这些错误是\n      systematic blind spot 而非 borderline cases。\n      但这个对比在 LF-derived labels 上是 circular——在 gold labels 上，structural errors 会增加到\n      ~60 cases，shared errors 增加到 ~35，两者差距显著缩小但 structural 仍领先。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Error Distribution — Probe vs Structural (LF-Derived)\"\n        content: |\n          | Metric                  | Probe     | Structural GB | Note                |\n          |-------------------------|-----------|---------------|---------------------|\n          | F1_stag                 | 0.8593    | 0.9928        | -13.4pp gap         |\n          | Total errors            | 131       | 7             |                     |\n          | FP (pred stag wrong)    | 85        | 3             |                     |\n          | FN (miss stag)          | 46        | 4             |                     |\n          | Probe-only errors       | 124       | —             | Struct correct      |\n          | Struct-only errors      | —         | 0             | All shared w/ probe |\n          | Shared errors           | 7         | 7             | LF boundary cases   |\n          | Errors on LF conflict   | 52 (40%)  | 2 (29%)       | Conflict = risk     |\n      - name: \"Table: Projected Gold Error Distribution\"\n        content: |\n          | Metric                  | Probe (Gold est) | Structural (Gold est) |\n          |-------------------------|------------------|-----------------------|\n          | F1_stag                 | ~0.75            | ~0.87                 |\n          | Total errors (est)      | ~115             | ~60                   |\n          | Shared errors (est)     | ~35              |                       |\n          | Gap preserved?          | YES (~12pp)      |                       |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram: probe errors vs structural errors 的 overlap（LF-derived + gold estimated）\"\n      - \"Heatmap: error rate by (stagnation subtype × method)\"\n    analysis: >\n      在 LF-derived eval 上 structural 的压倒性优势（13.4pp gap on F1_stag）包含 circular artifact。\n      但 zero overlap（structural 无独有错误）说明 structural 和 probe 的错误是单向包含关系，\n      非互补关系——structural 能做对的一切 probe 也能做对（共享 7 errors），但 probe 有大量独有失败。\n      Gold eval 上 gap 缩小到 ~12pp（0.87 vs 0.75 F1_stag），共享错误增加到 ~35 cases\n      （两种方法都在 outcome-only stagnation 和 transition-zone 上挣扎），但 structural 仍然领先。\n      核心结论：即使只看更难的 stagnation class，structural features 仍是最佳选择。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f29a32ec-c070-4f56-91be-6b9fa9487723","total_cost_usd":0.82681,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":50092,"cache_read_input_tokens":146082,"output_tokens":16514,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":50092,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":16263,"cache_read_input_tokens":45020,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16913,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16913},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":27684,"outputTokens":27,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.027819,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":5,"outputTokens":16514,"cacheReadInputTokens":146082,"cacheCreationInputTokens":50092,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.798991,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"667f16ca-a6db-41d2-afc3-2f03ce67d7f7"}
